            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A Psalm",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unto thee will I cry, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.28.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.28.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my rock; be not silent to me: lest,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.28.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.28.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou be silent to me, I become like them that go down into the pit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear the voice of my supplications, when I cry unto thee, when I lift up my hands toward thy holy oracle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw me not away with the wicked, and with the workers of iniquity, which speak peace to their neighbours, but mischief",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.28.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.28.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in their hearts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give them according to their deeds, and according to the wickedness of their endeavours: give them after the work of their hands; render to them their desert.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because they regard not the works of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.28.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.28.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", nor the operation of his hands, he shall destroy them, and not build them up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", because he hath heard the voice of my supplications.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
